### 1. Login Administrador (para obtener token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/administradores/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "federico@mail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Crear Comercio junto a su Licencia (Requiere Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/comercios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nombre": "Restaurante La Fontana",
  "licencia": {
    "clave": "LIC-LF-2026-PREMIUM-KEY",
    "max_activaciones": 5,
    "estado": "activa"
  }
}

### 3. Listar todos los Comercios con sus Licencias
GET {{baseUrl}}/comercios
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Obtener Comercio por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/comercios/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Actualizar Comercio
PUT {{baseUrl}}/comercios/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nombre": "Comercio Central POS Actualizado"
}

### 6. Eliminar Comercio (borra en cascada sus licencias)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comercios/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Prueba sin Token (Error 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/comercios
